  moveName: Moonlight Prance
  description: Leap with reduced movement and battle items available, stealing 50%
    of eligible enemy shields. Land with damage and a 1s stun; for 5s a following
    aura slows enemies by 30% and steals half of new shields. Stolen shields expire
    3s after the aura. Rayquaza and Assault Vest shields cannot be stolen. Learning
    this move grants 1% max-HP healing per second out of combat.
